1
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,470
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:46,800
[Episode 20]

3
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:47,290
[Adapted from Migu's novel
"Unsoiled Starlight"]

4
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:47,880
[Original Author: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:50,250
Congratulations on your wedding!

6
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:57,090
It's delicious!

7
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:58,680
Let's eat.

8
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:00,200
Here.

9
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,330
By the way, Tinglan,

10
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,930
is your law firm busy lately?

11
00:01:05,930 --> 00:01:07,580
I have a case from a financial company

12
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,310
and want to cooperate with you.

13
00:01:09,830 --> 00:01:12,190
Director Xiao needs
to review the case first.

14
00:01:12,190 --> 00:01:12,840
Well,

15
00:01:13,180 --> 00:01:14,220
you send me the documents,

16
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:15,060
I'll sort them out

17
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:16,180
and pass them to her tomorrow.

18
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:17,310
That's great!

19
00:01:17,340 --> 00:01:18,470
This financial project is...

20
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:19,930
Are we going to eat or what?

21
00:01:21,010 --> 00:01:22,420
"Are we going to eat or what? "

22
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:23,320
I forgot.

23
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,600
Your better half

24
00:01:24,820 --> 00:01:26,750
doesn't talk about work after hours.

25
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:27,400
You should

26
00:01:27,420 --> 00:01:28,539
keep a closer eye on him from now on.

27
00:01:28,539 --> 00:01:29,840
He's so inefficient.

28
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,400
Shut your mouth.

29
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:40,440
What's wrong?

30
00:01:40,830 --> 00:01:42,289
Are you in a bad mood today?

31
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:43,520
No,

32
00:01:43,979 --> 00:01:45,110
just a little tired.

33
00:01:46,630 --> 00:01:47,400
Just eat.

34
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,840
Shushu,

35
00:01:54,770 --> 00:01:56,440
you went to the hospital
for a follow-up checkup today.

36
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:57,770
What did the doctor say?

37
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:01,680
The doctor said it's fine,

38
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,080
and I'm recovering well.

39
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,200
What is it?

40
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:12,960
So mysterious

41
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,360
that we have to talk here.

42
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:22,000
I remember your dad used to work

43
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,640
in database-related jobs, right?

44
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:24,480
Yes,

45
00:02:25,210 --> 00:02:26,079
what's wrong?

46
00:02:26,530 --> 00:02:28,010
I want to ask your dad to help me

47
00:02:28,010 --> 00:02:29,940
introduce an expert in this field.

48
00:02:30,450 --> 00:02:31,280
Oh,

49
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:32,340
preferably someone

50
00:02:32,340 --> 00:02:35,400
who doesn't have deep ties
with commercial companies.

51
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:36,640
What happened?

52
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,040
Is it

53
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:43,440
related to Zhuo Yu'an?

54
00:02:44,460 --> 00:02:45,560
Not exactly,

55
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:46,740
but this matter

56
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:47,940
must be kept from him.

57
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,670
I can't explain it
clearly to you right now.

58
00:02:51,670 --> 00:02:52,640
Can you help me?

59
00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:55,240
Don't worry,

60
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:57,810
If you need me,
I will definitely be there.

61
00:02:59,579 --> 00:03:00,160
Alright,

62
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,360
leave it to me.

63
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:19,610
[Data error]

64
00:03:22,980 --> 00:03:23,390
[Data error]

65
00:03:28,270 --> 00:03:30,400
Why did you come back early today?

66
00:03:30,710 --> 00:03:32,320
Is there something wrong?

67
00:03:32,630 --> 00:03:33,400
Oh,

68
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:36,520
I plan to bring my mom home to live
next weekend,

69
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,720
so I want to come over
and clean up first.

70
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,040
Oh.

71
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:42,240
This door lock,

72
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,740
why isn't my code working?

73
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,510
Since you are away from home before,

74
00:03:46,510 --> 00:03:47,440
so I turned it off

75
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:48,360
for you.

76
00:03:49,410 --> 00:03:51,680
I saw it said some system error.

77
00:03:51,870 --> 00:03:53,530
It's been updating recently.

78
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:55,700
I'll register a new one for you later.

79
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:56,800
By the way,

80
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,079
I got a new sofa for you.

81
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,320
See if you like it.

82
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:22,970
Yes, Nannan.

83
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,380
I found the person for you.

84
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:26,080
He does academic research
at the institute,

85
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:27,400
and has absolutely no interest

86
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,340
in the deception of the business world.

87
00:04:28,340 --> 00:04:29,400
Your will meet him this afternoon

88
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,330
at the cafe opposite your company.

89
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,159
Okay.

90
00:04:32,550 --> 00:04:33,360
I got it.

91
00:04:37,570 --> 00:04:39,440
That's roughly my situation.

92
00:04:40,150 --> 00:04:41,960
So I wanted to ask

93
00:04:42,159 --> 00:04:43,700
if it's possible

94
00:04:43,730 --> 00:04:45,659
to find similar data in the system.

95
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:49,159
The cyber world
is just like the real world.

96
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:51,620
As long as it existed,
it will leave traces.

97
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,640
Recovering a system account

98
00:04:53,659 --> 00:04:55,190
is a very simple operation.

99
00:04:55,290 --> 00:04:57,360
But to access the backend database,

100
00:04:57,380 --> 00:04:59,600
only internal company personnel can do it.

101
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,400
External intrusion is illegal.

102
00:05:03,550 --> 00:05:04,610
I understand that.

103
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,880
So I wanted to ask Mr. He,

104
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:07,880
could there be

105
00:05:07,950 --> 00:05:08,960
any other way?

106
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,020
Coincidentally,

107
00:05:12,020 --> 00:05:12,950
our institution

108
00:05:13,010 --> 00:05:14,140
is currently researching

109
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:15,940
issues related to user privacy.

110
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,400
I can try to get

111
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,920
the official data

112
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,080
as a research case.

113
00:05:21,370 --> 00:05:23,010
But apart from your points of suspicion,

114
00:05:23,010 --> 00:05:24,760
I can't disclose other data.

115
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:26,090
Understood.

116
00:05:26,090 --> 00:05:27,220
Thank you very much.

117
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,650
I will also keep it strictly confidential.

118
00:05:29,650 --> 00:05:30,580
You're welcome.

119
00:05:46,330 --> 00:05:47,320
Work call.

120
00:05:47,540 --> 00:05:48,400
You go in first.

121
00:05:54,150 --> 00:05:54,570
Hello.

122
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,240
Mr. He.

123
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:58,159
I found the operation trajectory.

124
00:05:58,159 --> 00:05:59,960
There really is a hypnotic code.

125
00:06:00,210 --> 00:06:01,040
Really?

126
00:06:01,420 --> 00:06:02,560
Even luckier,

127
00:06:02,790 --> 00:06:04,140
the developer of the program and I

128
00:06:04,140 --> 00:06:05,670
worked together a while ago.

129
00:06:05,670 --> 00:06:06,480
He confirmed

130
00:06:06,580 --> 00:06:08,110
that it was commissioned by

131
00:06:08,130 --> 00:06:09,390
a foreign researcher.

132
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:11,360
But that person only promised
to use it for

133
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,420
internal testing.

134
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,930
I don't know how it got used
in your system.

135
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,680
The name of the commissioner,

136
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,280
is it convenient for you to tell me?

137
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:19,240
It's Jane.

138
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:31,120
Mom.

139
00:06:33,900 --> 00:06:34,900
What?

140
00:06:37,980 --> 00:06:39,920
Zhuo told me about your marriage.

141
00:06:40,290 --> 00:06:41,820
Mom, these are tears of joy.

142
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,520
As for being discharged,

143
00:06:44,780 --> 00:06:46,640
I don't want to add to your burden.

144
00:06:46,970 --> 00:06:48,700
I'll just stay in the hospital.

145
00:06:48,930 --> 00:06:50,350
If you have time in the future,

146
00:06:50,350 --> 00:06:51,480
just come and see me,

147
00:06:51,909 --> 00:06:53,320
and I'll be satisfied.

148
00:06:53,380 --> 00:06:54,120
Mom.

149
00:06:56,830 --> 00:06:57,400
Mom.

150
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,120
You don't need to worry about that.

151
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:01,120
Tinglan's business is my business.

152
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:03,280
I will always put Tinglan first.

153
00:07:04,470 --> 00:07:05,600
Then what if one day,

154
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:07,690
it's Zhuoyuan Technology and me?

155
00:07:12,330 --> 00:07:13,480
Lanlan.

156
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:16,010
Throwing a childish temper again.

157
00:07:16,850 --> 00:07:18,120
You two,

158
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,850
must live a good life together.

159
00:07:21,220 --> 00:07:22,560
Tolerate each other,

160
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:23,890
and learn to give in.

161
00:07:36,890 --> 00:07:37,720
Zhuo Yu'an.

162
00:07:39,190 --> 00:07:41,120
After packing up in a couple of days,

163
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,450
I want to move back home.

164
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:49,370
It's okay if
that house is empty for a while.

165
00:07:49,370 --> 00:07:50,000
Besides,

166
00:07:50,110 --> 00:07:51,420
since the company is closer to you,

167
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:52,770
isn't it more convenient?

168
00:07:52,770 --> 00:07:53,630
I just feel like

169
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:55,800
you don't really want me to move back.

170
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:56,920
Not at all.

171
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:02,880
Did you know

172
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:06,220
there was something wrong with that house?

173
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,400
I knew it.

174
00:08:15,590 --> 00:08:16,800
Then since you knew,

175
00:08:17,790 --> 00:08:19,050
why didn't you tell me?

176
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:25,540
The company is already conducting
an internal investigation.

177
00:08:25,540 --> 00:08:26,870
The process is ongoing.

178
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:29,040
As for Wen Jian,

179
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:30,480
I won't let her participate

180
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:32,640
in the development
of any core content anymore.

181
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:35,039
I've already arranged for her
to go abroad.

182
00:08:37,429 --> 00:08:38,690
From beginning to end,

183
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:41,080
when did I ever mention Wen Jian?

184
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:45,200
So you knew all along

185
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,400
the reason for my illness,

186
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:48,330
and you even knew who was behind it.

187
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,760
You didn't tell me immediately.

188
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:52,600
You're even covering up for her.

189
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,440
I'm not covering up for Wen Jian.

190
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,360
I need time.

191
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,280
I need a suitable opportunity

192
00:08:58,280 --> 00:08:59,600
to handle this matter.

193
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,880
She is your partner.

194
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:05,740
But do you even know
what Wen Jian and I are to each other?

195
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:09,690
She is Shu Minghai's
illegitimate daughter.

196
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:14,800
Shu Minghai,

197
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,840
who is my father in name,

198
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,400
had the nerve to

199
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,480
to make her my neighbor.

200
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,280
We grew up together.

201
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:26,720
Under the guise

202
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:28,600
that their family had no man,

203
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:31,640
he asked my mom to take good care of them.

204
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,680
Growing up,

205
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:34,980
in everything,

206
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:36,680
he always taught me

207
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:37,920
to go easy on Wen Jian.

208
00:09:39,150 --> 00:09:40,480
But what was the result?

209
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:42,600
After he died,

210
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,920
he left all his property to them.

211
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,440
My mom and I

212
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:49,800
only got a useless corpse

213
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,880
and his debts.

214
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,240
Even

215
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,800
my mom becoming like this

216
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:00,650
is also their fault.

217
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,890
After what happened last time,

218
00:10:06,140 --> 00:10:07,340
I originally thought

219
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:09,220
everything could be brushed off.

220
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:13,440
We could live our lives
without interfering with each other.

221
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,120
She actually went even further

222
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,240
and wanted my life.

223
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:19,720
Zhuo Yu'an,

224
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:23,320
where exactly do you put

225
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,960
me and my interests?

226
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,440
Shu Tinglan,

227
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:35,050
you and I always share the same interests.

228
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:37,100
You have to believe me on this.

229
00:10:38,300 --> 00:10:39,880
But between Wen Jian and me,

230
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:42,000
there is a company to maintain.

231
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:44,490
I need to figure out a proper way

232
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,800
to completely resolve this matter.

233
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:54,530
That's exactly your way
of doing things, Zhuo Yu'an.

234
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,770
But as the person involved,

235
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,530
and even more as the victim,

236
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:02,610
I can't weigh the pros and cons
like you do.

237
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:05,320
Since you can't solve it,

238
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,660
then whatever I do from now on,

239
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,240
I don't need your approval

240
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,010
or your opinion.

241
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:14,200
If you don't agree with my approach,

242
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:19,200
let's dissolve our marriage.

243
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:26,560
Shu Tinglan.

244
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,360
This is too much.

245
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,880
How could he do this?

246
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:51,960
Shushu.

247
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:54,520
Let's put aside
what Zhuo Yu'an did now.

248
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:56,040
The most important thing is this Wen Jian.

249
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,280
If you go easy on her this time,

250
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:59,960
she will definitely be
even more brazen next time.

251
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:00,840
Got it.

252
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,800
I don't plan to go easy on her.

253
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,280
It's just...

254
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:09,260
You just don't want
to implicate Zhuo Yu'an.

255
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,140
Thinking about it,

256
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,800
it's all Zhuo Yu'an's fault.

257
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:17,000
Why did he have to partner with Wen Jian?

258
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,320
In that case,

259
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:21,610
we might as well blame Shu Minghai.

260
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,780
He's been dead for so long.

261
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,120
One person's mistake

262
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,850
makes so many people pay for it.

263
00:12:31,030 --> 00:12:31,580
Nannan.

264
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:33,340
About this matter,

265
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:35,240
I didn't want to drag you into it.

266
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:38,240
But if I want to use
online public opinion and trends,

267
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:39,440
I can only rely on you.

268
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,040
Don't worry.

269
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:44,160
When have I ever

270
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:45,680
have I ever let you down?

271
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:48,280
Alright, leave it to me.

272
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:49,360
Leave it to me.

273
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,720
Knockout with one punch.

274
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:54,080
Alright, alright.

275
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,920
Just leave it to me.

276
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:59,440
Alright, don't worry.
